<h2 class="wp-block-heading">The Linen Closet Shelf Map</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Before you fold anything, decide what goes where. The easiest system for linen closet organization is to store by how often you reach for each item: daily things at eye level, rarely used things up high, and bulky things on the floor.</p>



